<title>SWEDEN: MoDo 1996 results by business area.</title>
<headline>MoDo 1996 results by business area.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish forestry group MoDo results for business areas for the 12 months ending December 31, 1996, compared with a year earlier.</p>
<p> OPERATING PROFIT  (MLN SKR)	1996		 1995</p>
<p> MoDo Paper				 97		 2,331</p>
<p> Holmen Paper			  1,824		 1,570</p>
<p> Iggesund Paperboard		   591		   896</p>
<p> MoDo Merchants			   76		   175</p>
<p> Iggesund Timber			 -53		    17</p>
<p> MoDo Skog				 357		   391</p>
<p> Others				    387		   169</p>
<p> Non-recurring items		    11		   282</p>
<p> TOTAL				   3,290		 5,831</p>
<p> SALES (Mln skr)			 1996		 1995</p>
<p> MoDo Paper			     6,917		8,919</p>
<p> Holmen Paper			   7,109		6,565</p>
<p> Iggesund Paperboard		  3,845		4,232</p>
<p> MoDo Merchants			 3,482		4,135</p>
<p> Iggesund Timber			  764		  856</p>
<p> Internal deliveries		 -2,002	     -2,388</p>
<p> TOTAL				   20,115	     22,319</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
